{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"拓扑序"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“拓扑序”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#数学物理</p>\n<p>拓扑序 (topological order) 是指有长程纠缠的量子物态. 所谓长程纠缠, 是指不能被局部线性等距变换消除的纠缠.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>非对称</th><th>对称</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>短程纠缠</td><td>平凡物态</td><td>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称保护拓扑物态","text":"对称保护拓扑物态"}},{"Plain":"</td></tr>\n<tr><td>长程纠缠</td><td>拓扑序</td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}]}}